   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="20051103_0010.jpg" type="recto"/>
   <note type="archival" hand="#h02" place="top">6</note>
   <lg type="poem">
     <l><del rend="overstrike">A fleeter</del></l>
     <l>An impulse <add place="below"><metamark target="#a001" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">thrilling its</add> <del rend="overstrike">in a</del> brain cell</l>
     <l>A phantom of the moment silent<lb/> stalking sudden</l>
    <l>A flutter as <del rend="overstrike">the</del> if <add place="below"><metamark target="#a002" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">old</add> Time's and Spaces <del rend="overstrike"><add place="below"><metamark target="#a003" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a003">old world</add></del><lb/> secret were <del rend="overstrike"><add place="below"><metamark target="#a004" function="add" rend="marked">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a004">some of it</add></del> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">to open</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">opening</add></del></subst> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">somehow</del><add place="above" seq="2">revealing</add></subst></l>
    <l>A thought! a <add place="below"><metamark target="#a005" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a005">full-formed</add> thought works <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">forth</del><add place="above" seq="2">into shape</add></subst>&#8212;<lb/> four <seg xml:id="alt001">centuries</seg><add place="above" xml:id="alt002">hundred years</add><alt target="#alt001 #alt002" /> roll on</l>
    <l>And here to-day the Western World!</l>
    <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">The</del><del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">In</add></del></subst> <add place="below"><metamark target="#a006" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a006">The</add> <gap reason="illegible" extent="one word"/> cumulus <del rend="overstrike"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one character"/></del> ships, people,<lb/> trade, <add place="below"><metamark target="#a007" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007">war, peace</add> democracy, roll on</l>
    <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">As manifold</del><add place="above" seq="2">The</add></subst> armies <del rend="overstrike" seq="1">by their leader led</del><add place="above" seq="2">and the fleet follow their leader</add><lb/> &#8212;the camps are polish'd</l>
   </lg>
   <note type="archival" hand="#h02" place="bottom">[6]</note>

   <pb xml:id="leaf001v" facs="20051103_0011.jpg" type="verso"/>
   
</body>
